#. あれ…あれれ…？
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Huh? Huuuuh!?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだよこれ…
#. なんなんだよ…！
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What's this? What's going on!?"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、今のって…！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, was that...!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あぁ…間違いねーべ！
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ah! Yeah, it had to be!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>アルターエゴ<CLT>…！
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Alter Ego<CLT>...!"
msgstr ""

#. …アルターエゴ！？
msgctxt "0006 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...Alter Ego!?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか…あいつの仕掛けたウィルス…？
msgctxt "0007 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Is this some stupid virus from that stupid guy!?"
msgstr ""

#. さては、ネットワークに侵入した時だな…
msgctxt "0008 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "He must have planted it when he invaded my network...!"
msgstr ""

#. チクショウ…やりやがったな…！
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Damn it all to hell! I don't believe this!"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら計算が狂ったみたいね…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It seems you finally made a miscalculation."
msgstr ""

#. いえ、狂いっぱなしね…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No...you miscalculated from the very beginning."
msgstr ""

#. …なんだって？
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...What was that?"
msgstr "...Cái gì cơ?"

#. 私達の事を甘く見過ぎていたって事よ…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What I'm saying is, you shouldn't have underestimated\n"
"us."
msgstr ""

#. フン…何を勝ち誇った気になってんのさ…！
msgctxt "0014 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmph! Why are you talking like you've already won!?"
msgstr ""

#. 別に…痛くもかゆくもないよ…
msgctxt "0015 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I barely felt a thing! It was a pinch, an itch!"
msgstr ""

#. 妙なウィルスだって今ので終わりだろ？
#. それに、苗木クンだってそうだよ。
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"The stupid virus is gone now, got it!? And so is\n"
"Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. ペッタンコにならずには済んだけど、
#. 彼は２度と戻って来られないはずだよ…
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Maybe I didn't get to smash him flat, but you're never\n"
"gonna see him again!"
msgstr ""

#. ゴミだらけの地下でじわじわと殺されるなんて…
#. ある意味、一番しんどい、おしおきかもね。
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"To waste away in a garbage-strewn pit... In a way,\n"
"that's an even BETTER special punishment!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うぷ…うぷぷぷ……
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhu... Puhuhu...!"
msgstr ""

#. だけど足りない…まだ足りないよ…
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But it's still not enough... I'm still not satisfied!"
msgstr ""

#. まだまだ、オマエラに絶望を与えてやるよ…
#. まだまだ、世界に絶望を与えてやるよ…
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I'm still gonna bring despair to the rest of you—bring\n"
"despair to the entire world...!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…うぷぷ…うぷぷ…うぷぷ…うぷぷ…うぷぷ…
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... Puhuhu... Puhuhu... Puhuhu... Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷ…うぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhu...!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 行っちまった…のか…？
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Is he...gone?"
msgstr ""

#. おい、霧切…これはどういう事だ？
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hey, Kyoko. What's the meaning of all this?"
msgstr ""

#. 一体…何が起きているんだ…？
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Just what the hell is going on?"
msgstr ""

#. …大丈夫よ。追い詰められてるのは私達じゃないわ。
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's okay. We're not the ones being trapped this time."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0030 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. むしろ、追い詰められているのは黒幕の方なのよ…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Now it's the mastermind that's ensnared..."
msgstr ""

#. どういう…意味だ…？
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What are you talking about...?"
msgstr ""

#. すぐに…わかるわ…
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You'll understand soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. すぐにね……
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Very soon indeed..."
msgstr ""
